"ipmitool chassis bootparam set bootflag ... options=no-timeout" failed on the option
(the parser took no-timeout for an error). Upstream b67f400 (codeberg pull request 19),
as Debian carries it (0130-chassis_bootparam.patch, bug 1099886); not in ipmitool
1.8.19 nor in the official port.

--- lib/ipmi_chassis.c.orig
+++ lib/ipmi_chassis.c
@@ -1049,7 +1049,7 @@ get_bootparam_options(char *optstring,
 			optionError = 1;
 			break;
 		}
-		if (!strcmp(token, "no-")) {
+		if (strncmp(token, "no-", 3) == 0) {
 			setbit = 1;
 			token += 3;
 		}
